# Input

```md
# Blocks that keep their source indentation

- item

  <div>
    html
  </div>

      indented code

  > quote
  > more

  [ref]: /url

  paragraph

# Block on the line after a blockquote

- item
  > quote
  ```
  code
  ```

  paragraph

# Nested list that cannot move

- item
  - nested

    <div>
      html
    </div>

  paragraph

- item
  - nested
    > quote

  paragraph

# Suppressed blocks

- item

  <!-- biome-ignore format: reason -->
  suppressed   paragraph

  paragraph

- item

  <!-- biome-ignore format: reason -->
  - suppressed   list
    - suppressed   nested

  paragraph

# List in a blockquote

> - item
>
>   paragraph
>   - nested

# First block

- - nested
  - sibling

  paragraph

- # heading

  paragraph

- ```
  code
  ```

  paragraph

# Paragraph line that starts with a block marker

- item

  The count is
  14. More text.

  paragraph

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "indentWidth": 4
    },
    "parser": {
      "gfm": true
    }
  }
}
```

